# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession draft Tailoring --out` from Era-baseline data. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/tailoring
title Tailoring 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Era-baseline data:
# Blizzard Classic Era client tables (recipes, skill thresholds, reagents,
# vendor prices) via wago.tools, pfQuest (vendors, drops, nodes) and a curated
# trainer list checked against npcs.json. Nothing public confirms Forever
# changed profession recipes, so the Era recipe list is the baseline.
#
# Trainers and vendors are smart targets: the engine sends each character to
# the nearest one of its faction. Farming spots are picked per faction.
#
# Recipe choice: cheapest expected cost to 300 (Classic skill-up chances:
# certain while orange, falling from yellow to grey), with gathered materials
# valued at 4x their vendor sell price; see tools/lib/professions/plan.js.
# Material counts are expected values; yellow and green crafts can take more.
#
# Route:
#     1-50  Linen Cloak (about 57)
#    50-75  Linen Belt (about 43)
#    75-85  Red Linen Shirt (about 18)
#    85-107 Reinforced Linen Cape (about 34)
#   107-125 Woolen Cape (about 35)
#   125-150 Red Woolen Bag (about 27)
#   150-175 Gloves of Meditation (about 52)
#   175-215 Azure Silk Cloak (about 52)
#   215-225 Crimson Silk Pantaloons (about 14)
#   225-230 Black Mageweave Vest (about 7)
#   230-245 Black Mageweave Gloves (about 21)
#   245-255 Black Mageweave Headband (about 12)
#   255-259 Bolt of Runecloth (about 7)
#   259-275 Tuxedo Jacket (about 18)
#   275-300 Runecloth Gloves (about 27)

step Apprentice Tailoring
  tip Tailoring runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 1g 12s in all.
  train Tailoring Apprentice
  skill Tailoring 1
  buy 2320 x100 nearest

step Linen Cloth
  tip Kill the mobs that drop it at the farm spot Polestar picks for your level and faction. The Auction House works too.
  collect 2589 x200 nearest

step Linen Cloak to 50
  tip Orange (a point every craft) until 35, yellow until 47, green until 60.
  craft 2963 x57
  craft 2387 until 50

step Tailoring recipes at 50
  tip Back to a Tailoring trainer: Linen Belt is taught from Tailoring 50.
  learn 8776

step Linen Belt to 75
  tip Yellow until 67, green until 85: not every craft gives a point. 75 is the Apprentice cap.
  craft 2963 x43
  craft 8776 until 75
  skill Tailoring 75

